Z||000003||Smoooooth GT||11-25-2001||12:40 AM||||HHhmm..  I say SAVE the Formula!!! Use part's from the coupe to rebiuld or whatever you need to do .....  Formula's are becoming hard to find!! Here in Tyler there are 16 Fiero's in the salvage yard's. NO FORMULA'S They have 4GT's, 2 2m6's, and the rest are 4cyl. coupes... well one of the GT's have a 4 cyl. look's funny in there too!!  Save the Formula!!!! Steve<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Smooooth_Yellow_sig_3.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/texas_1.gif">          <BR>Shaved door handles, sidetrim, exhaust outlet's, etc.... smooooth!!!||||reg||1
